MOVE_OBJECT_TO_RECEP.sys_output_format:
NOTE: Output JSON only. You do NOT output context.

[OUTPUT PROTOCOL]
- Return JSON ONLY.
- Top-level MUST be an object with key "patch_ops" (a list).
- Even for ONE op, you MUST wrap it: {"patch_ops":[{...}]}
- If you output a single op object without "patch_ops", the program will DISCARD your update.

[OUTPUT FORMAT]
{
  "patch_ops": [
    {
      "op": "<set>",
      "path": "<return.moved_target_object_location>",
      "value": "<json value>"
    }
  ]
}

